<body data-time="past">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Fret<b>work</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="/#how">How it works</a><a href="/#what">What we do</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/start">Start</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#book">Start a conversation</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team mapping a process on a whiteboard" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
        <h1>Start with a free call. <em>Bring one workflow.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tell us the one thing costing your team the most time. In 30 minutes we map how it flows today, tell you what is broken, and what it would cost to fix. No obligation.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#book">Pick a time</a></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Look</h3><p>A 30-minute call. We map how your work flows today.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Fix</h3><p>A fixed price. We connect your tools and automate the busywork.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Hand off</h3><p>Your team runs it. We stay on only if you want us to.</p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">The first call is free. The Systems Review is $1,500. The Rebuild starts at $7,500 and is quoted in writing, at one fixed price, before any work begins. Keeping it running starts at $750 a month, optional.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="book"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p><h2>Pick a time that suits you.</h2><p class="lede">You'll get a calendar invite with the video link.</p></div>
      <div class="bookbox"><div class="contact-panel" style="padding:28px 26px;border:1px solid rgba(139,146,153,.35);border-radius:12px;text-align:left"><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.75">Call</p><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600"><a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;opacity:.8">Call and ask for Russ. If he's with someone, leave a message and he'll call you back.</p></div>
</body>
</html>
